& [InputForms]
  + DiffInventory repository identity branch predecessor entries inventory_sha256
  + DiffEntry status old_path new_path before_sha256 after_sha256
  + ChangeSetManifest repository identity branch predecessor inventory_sha256 turn conversation nodes edges events foreign_exclusions change_set_sha256

& [GraphForms]
  + GraphNode node_id kind repository_path content_sha256
  + GraphEdge edge_id kind source_node_id target_node_id
  + exact nineteen node kinds and sixteen edge kinds from SJSRepositoryGraph

& [EventForm]
  + profile event_uuid element_id operation turn_uuid conversation_uuid change_set_uuid covered_changes
  + source requirement constraint justification plan evidence proof narrative and frontier node refs
  + reason_summary before_sha256 after_sha256 nonclaims unresolved_frontier generated event_sha256

& [ValidationPasses]
  + P01 profiles and encoded resource bounds
  + P02 repository UUID commit branch semantic and SHA identities
  + P03 normalized paths and unique diff coordinates
  + P04 diff status identity-shape compatibility and inventory digest
  + P05 graph node uniqueness content coupling and kind closure
  + P06 graph edge uniqueness endpoint existence self-edge and duplicate-triple refusal
  + P07 event uniqueness refs text transition coverage and event digest
  + P08 operation-to-diff compatibility tombstone rename and generated rules
  + P09 bidirectional coverage foreign disjointness and graph representation
  + P10 change-set independent inventory join change-set digest receipt and replay

& [MachineForms]
  + serde deny_unknown_fields on every record and snake_case closed enums
  + compact declaration-order JSON and bounded from/to functions
  + result digest clears only result_sha256

& [CLI]
  + cantor-sjs-graph-verify --change-set PATH --diff-inventory PATH [--output PATH]
  + exact argument duplication omission unknown option input bound JSON fault and output failure refusal
  + stdout pretty JSON when output absent and optional bounded parent creation when output present

& [AdversarialSet]
  + unknown field invalid profile UUID semantic ID commit branch path SHA and overbound text
  + duplicate diff node edge event element ref coverage or foreign path
  + missing coverage extra event path generated mismatch deletion without tombstone rename without continuity
  + dangling edge wrong typed ref missing event graph nodes foreign overlap inventory digest request digest and receipt replay tamper

& [Authority]
  + validation_only physical_contact false
  + no Git process workspace mutation stage commit push provider network activation or self-signature
